  "title": "Hey Big Spender, How Are You Doing?",
  "summary": "Today is shaping up to be a highly consequential one for markets. As discussed yesterday, we have an FOMC meeting this afternoon. Despite some talk about the potential for a rate hike, the most likely scenario priced into Fed Funds futures and prediction markets is for a “hawkish hold”. Then, less than an hour after Chair Warsh leaves the podium, we expect to get quarterly results from Microsoft (MSFT) and Meta Platforms (META). Based on the reaction to Alphabet’s (GOOG, GOOGL) report last week, it’s hard to know what to root for.",
